menuconfig SYSTEMCMDS_UORB_WAIT_KERNEL
	bool "uorb_wait_kernel"
	default n
	depends on BOARD_PROTECTED && PLATFORM_NUTTX && BOARD_ARCHITECTURE = "cortex-m7"
	---help---
		Fixed kernel observer and producer for uorb_wait_smoke.
		Observes only the invoking task's normal semaphore wait and publishes
		only sequential diagnostic samples on orb_test instance zero.
